---
/**
 * DistributorRequirements — Informational section for potential
 * allied cafés and distributors to learn registration requirements.
 */
---

<section class='bg-muted/40 py-16 sm:py-24'>
  <div class='mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8'>
    <div class='grid items-start gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2'>
      <!-- Left: intro text -->
      <div class='space-y-6 lg:sticky lg:top-32'>
        <div
          class='border-primary/30 bg-primary/5 text-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium'
        >
          Programa de Distribuidores (Requisitos)
        </div>

        <h2 class='text-foreground font-serif text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-4xl'>
          ¿Quieres llevar nuestro café a tu negocio?
        </h2>

        <p class='text-muted-foreground text-lg leading-relaxed'>
          Únete a nuestra red de cafeterías aliadas y distribuidores autorizados. Ofrecemos precios preferenciales,
          soporte de marca y un producto de calidad consistente que tus clientes amarán.
        </p>

        <a
          href='/contacto'
          class='bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90 inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full px-8 text-base font-semibold shadow-sm transition-colors'
        >
          Solicitar registro
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: requirements card -->
      <div class='border-border/80 bg-card space-y-1 rounded-2xl border p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8'>
        <h3 class='border-border text-foreground flex items-center gap-3 border-b pb-5 font-serif text-xl font-bold'>
          <svg
            xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
            viewBox='0 0 24 24'
            fill='none'
            stroke='currentColor'
            stroke-width='2'
            stroke-linecap='round'
            stroke-linejoin='round'
            class='text-primary h-5 w-5'
          >
            <path d='M16 20V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16'></path>
            <rect width='20' height='14' x='2' y='6' rx='2'></rect>
          </svg>
          Requisitos para Registro
        </h3>

        <ul class='divide-border/60 divide-y'>
          <!-- Requirement 1 -->
          <li class='flex items-start gap-4 py-5'>
            <div
              class='bg-primary/10 text-primary mt-0.5 flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full'
            >
              <svg
                xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                fill='none'
                stroke='currentColor'
                stroke-width='2'
                stroke-linecap='round'
                stroke-linejoin='round'
                class='h-4 w-4'
              >
                <path d='M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z'></path>
                <path d='M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4'></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class='text-foreground font-semibold'>RTN de empresa o comerciante</p>
              <p class='text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm'>
                Registro Tributario Nacional vigente como persona natural o jurídica.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>

          <!-- Requirement 2 -->
          <li class='flex items-start gap-4 py-5'>
            <div
              class='bg-primary/10 text-primary mt-0.5 flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full'
            >
              <svg
                xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                fill='none'
                stroke='currentColor'
                stroke-width='2'
                stroke-linecap='round'
                stroke-linejoin='round'
                class='h-4 w-4'
              >
                <path d='M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10'></path>
                <path d='m9 12 2 2 4-4'></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class='text-foreground font-semibold'>Permiso de operación vigente</p>
              <p class='text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm'>
                Licencia o permiso municipal actualizado que autorice la operación de su establecimiento.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>

          <!-- Requirement 3 -->
          <li class='flex items-start gap-4 py-5'>
            <div
              class='bg-primary/10 text-primary mt-0.5 flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full'
            >
              <svg
                xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                fill='none'
                stroke='currentColor'
                stroke-width='2'
                stroke-linecap='round'
                stroke-linejoin='round'
                class='h-4 w-4'
              >
                <path d='M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4Z'></path>
                <path d='M3 6h18'></path>
                <path d='M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0'></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class='text-foreground font-semibold'>Compra mínima de 20 libras mensuales</p>
              <p class='text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm'>
                Compromiso de pedido mensual mínimo para mantener precios preferenciales de distribuidor.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>

          <!-- Requirement 4 -->
          <li class='flex items-start gap-4 py-5'>
            <div
              class='bg-primary/10 text-primary mt-0.5 flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full'
            >
              <svg
                xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                fill='none'
                stroke='currentColor'
                stroke-width='2'
                stroke-linecap='round'
                stroke-linejoin='round'
                class='h-4 w-4'
              >
                <path d='M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z'></path>
                <circle cx='12' cy='10' r='3'></circle>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class='text-foreground font-semibold'>Dirección de entrega</p>
              <p class='text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm'>
                Dirección completa del establecimiento donde se recibirán los pedidos.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>

          <!-- Requirement 5 -->
          <li class='flex items-start gap-4 py-5'>
            <div
              class='bg-primary/10 text-primary mt-0.5 flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full'
            >
              <svg
                xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                fill='none'
                stroke='currentColor'
                stroke-width='2'
                stroke-linecap='round'
                stroke-linejoin='round'
                class='h-4 w-4'
              >
                <path d='M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2'></path>
                <circle cx='12' cy='7' r='4'></circle>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class='text-foreground font-semibold'>Contacto del encargado de compras</p>
              <p class='text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm'>
                Nombre, teléfono y correo electrónico de la persona responsable de los pedidos.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
